    "type": 0,
    "content": "**Artifact Find Chance - Collection**\n\n**-- World 1 --**\n* Bribes\n--> % Bonus - (20%) -- Artifact Pilfering\n\n* Star Signs\n--> % Bonus - (15%) -- Hydron -> 'Artifosho'\n\n* Upgrade Vault\n--> % Bonus  -- Artifact Find Chance (Below Vault Mastery 2)\n\n\n**-- World 2 --**\n* Arcade Shop (Spirit Reindeer is x2)\n--> % Bonus - (25% normal, 50% Super) - Blue Background Artifact Find\n--> % Bonus - (30% normal, 60% Super)- Yellow Background Artifact Find\n\n* Fractal Island\n--> x Multiplier - (1.20x) - 2500 Hours Nothing AFK\n\n* Killroy\n--> x Multiplier\n\n* Vote Ballot\n--> x Multiplier \n\n* Alchemy Vial\n--> % Bonus Multiplicative - Turtle Tisane Vial\n\n\n**-- World 4 --**\n* Laboratory Mainframe\n--> x Multiplier - (1.5x) - Artifact Attraction (Unlocked in JadeEmporium)\n\n* Laboratory Console\n--> Star sign doubler \n(Make sure you have ArtifactFindChance star sign equipped)\n(Hydron -> 'Artifosho')\n\n* Tome bonus\n--> x Multiplier (More score = higher ArtifactFindChance)\n\n* Breeding Shiny Pets\n--> % Bonus - (Soda can, Tyson, Mamooth -- Shiny passive bonus)\n\n_",
