  {
    "type": 0,
    "content": "**-- World 5 --**\n* Sailing Islands\n--> % Bonus - (1% per sailing LV.) - Safari island = Fauxory Tusk Artifact\n\n* Sailing Captains\n--> % Bonus - (+ ArtifactFindChance bonus on captains)\n--> % Bonus Multiplicative - (Endercaptain +25% multi account-wide bonus, per captain)\n\n* Gaming Duper Bits\n--> x Multiplier - (1.02x per Spelunk Discovery) - 'Artifacto Discoveries'\n\n* Gaming Palette\n--> x Multiplier - (Bright Cyan)\n\n* Hole - Engineer\n--> % Bonus - 10% for every Power of 10 Natural Notes (Tune of Artifaction)\n\n* Hole - Monument of Justice\n--> x Multiplier\n\n\n**-- World 6 --**\n* Farming Exotic Market\n--> x Multiplier (5 Leaf Clover)\n\n* Farming Stickers\n--> % Bonus - (Chocotastic Muffin Sticker (3rd crop))\n\n* Sneaking Charms\n--> x Multiplier - (1.40x) - Pristine charm \"Glowing Veil\"\n\n* Summoning Winner Bonus\n--> x Multiplier\n\n* Summoning Battle - (Thanks to Chairnatomy for filling the list)\n--> x Multiplier (1.53x) - Battle White 5\n--> x Multiplier (1.7x) - Battle Green 8\n--> x Multiplier (1.53x) - Battle Green 12\n--> x Multiplier (1.7x) - Battle Yellow 10\n--> x Multiplier (1.7x) - Battle Blue 8\n--> x Multiplier (1.88x) - Battle Purple 11\n--> x Multiplier (1.53x) - Battle Red 12\n--> x Multiplier (1.6x) - Battle Teal 2\n--> x Multiplier (1.7x) - Battle Teal 7\n--> x Multiplier (1.81x) - Battle Teal 11\n\n\n\n**-- World 7 --**\n* Research\n--> % Bonus - ResearchGrid J7 (Transcendent Artifacts)\n\n* Legend Talents\n--> x Multiplier - (1.60x bonus to \"Davey Jones Training\" gemshop purchase)\nBrown 7\n\n\n**-- Gemshop --**\n* World 5 Bonuses\n--> x Multiplier - Davey Jones Training (8 upgrades)\n\n\n**-- Pets --**\n* Shallow Waters\n--> x Multiplier (1.25x) - Litterfish\n\n* Exclusive Pets\n--> x Multiplier (2.00x) - Glimbo",
